# Campaign configurations carrying real API keys never reach the repository.
# LLM-08 states the constraint as non-negotiable: no key in the repo, in the matrix,
# or in an archived trace. The generated reports are versioned — they are the evidence
# the campaigns exist to produce — but they are built from observed behaviour only.
*.local.json
*.secrets.json
*.local.*.json

# Scratch output from a --dry-run or an interrupted run.
.campaign-tmp/

# Throwaway --out roots, for replaying one mode several times to tell a real regression
# apart from model sampling. Inside the repo because that is the only path shared between
# a WSL shell and a container that mounts it elsewhere; ignored because they are not evidence.
.out-*/

# Staging file the index rebuild renames into place; only ever left behind by a crash.
.README.md.*
